<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Trading halt on Foster's shares.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Trading halt on Foster's shares.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) said on Thursday that Foster's Brewing Group Ltd had sought a trading halt on its shares.</p>
<p>It said the halt was pending an announcement to made shortly by the company about a number of major transactions relating to more than 50 percent of Foster's issued ordinary capital.</p>
</text>
